# Canonical author identity for this repository.
#
# Each line maps a *commit email* to the correct name and email. Matching on
# the email alone is deliberate: it rewrites the name on every commit that used
# that address, so no previous name needs to be recorded in this file.
#
# The canonical address is xistence@0x58.com rather than the one on the resume,
# because that is the address carried as a UID on the GPG signing key. Commits
# signed under an address the key does not cover show up as Unverified.
#
# Note this only affects how git itself renders history -- git log, shortlog,
# blame, and anything built on them. The commit objects are unchanged, and
# GitHub's web interface does not read .mailmap.

Delta Regeer <xistence@0x58.com> <bertjw@regeer.org>
Delta Regeer <xistence@0x58.com> <xistence@0x58.com>
